<header class=\"top\"><h1>The Desk~w</h1>~w<nav class=\"lanes\" aria-label=\"Stores\">~w</nav><div class=\"folds\">~w<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn small\" data-folds=\"open\">Expand all</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn small\" data-folds=\"close\">Collapse all</button></div></header>
~w
