"  hub query 'GOAL' [-n N] | hub ledger ARGS | hub stores | hub files STORE | hub orphans   [--hub DIR] (help hub)",
"  drop-goal G --by human --note TEXT      the owner drops a goal of the project KB (help hub)",
"  s1-record [--hub DIR] [--session S] --json      the record of the active ticket for System 1 (help hub)",
