help_lines(strike, [
"orbit-kb strike X --why TEXT [--disclose TEXT] [--by human|agent]",
"",
"X no longer counts in any rule (show open, blocking, fulfilled), and it stays in kb.pl and in the",
"report as struck: struck(X, By, Time, Why) is appended. X is the id of an item (a claim, a check, a",
"question, a finding, a premise, a signal, an attestation, ...), or KIND(ITEM)#N for an attachment",
"(a note, an example, an option, an answer): the Nth fact of that kind on that item, in the order of",
"kb.pl. A record of the human (a request, or a fact with the argument human) is changed by an",
"agent only with --disclose TEXT (what the human said, and where); the Desk shows it to the human",
"as a divergence (struck_disclosure/4). orbit-kb help replace and help erase are the other two.",
"Takes the writer lock."
]).
help_lines(replace, [
"orbit-kb replace X 'NEW FACT' ['MORE FACTS'] [--why TEXT] [--disclose TEXT] [--by human|agent]",
"",
"NEW (and any more facts, such as the checks_that of a new check) is added with the checks of add. For an item X (an id), NEW is an item with an id of its own and",
"supersedes(NEWID, X) is added in the same write: X no longer counts, for any kind of item. For an",
"attachment X (KIND(ITEM)#N), X is struck. A record of the human needs --disclose TEXT (see help strike).",
"Takes the writer lock."
]).
help_lines(erase, [
"orbit-kb erase X --why TEXT [--disclose TEXT] [--by human|agent]",
"",
"For a record added by mistake (a typo, the wrong KB): its line leaves kb.pl, an item with its",
"attachments (each fact whose first argument is its id). One line stays: erased(X, By, Time, Why), with no",
"text; the text is only in git. Any other record is struck, not erased (help strike). A record of the",
